#confirmDelete.confirm-delete-mini-modal
  .confirm-delete-dialog
    .modal-content
      .confirm-delete-header
        h4.confirm-delete-title Are you sure you want to delete this PDF?
      .confirm-delete-body
        | If you do, you won't be able to recover it.
        .btn-row(style="padding-top: 15px;")
          button.btn((click)="dismiss.emit()", type="button") Cancel
          button#pdfDelBtnConfirm((click)="confirm.emit()", type="button") Delete